{"title":"1984 AHSME Problems/Problem 26","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_26&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>In the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Obtuse_triangle\" title=\"Obtuse triangle\">obtuse triangle</a> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/a/e2a559986ed5a0ffc5654bd367c29dfc92913c36.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"44\" height=\"14\" /> with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/f/9/6f94c8c21ca16669544bc741b14c5e1c2c63192a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle C&gt;90^\\circ$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"75\" height=\"13\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/e/3/2e3d65705fa873f2404c005b70f976018a4a8bc4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AM=MB$\" width=\"91\" height=\"13\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/5/a/a5abec90d02598055024494ebbfa831ad23ee48f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$MD\\perp BC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"90\" height=\"14\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/8/d/68dbbf9b46dff5c2b4ca7f95caf2cc7310afed75.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$EC\\perp BC$\" width=\"81\" height=\"12\" /> (<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/f/9ffb448918db29f2a72f8f87f421b3b3cad18f95.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$D$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> is on <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/5/6c52a41dcbd739f1d026c5d4f181438b75b76976.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"31\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/a/2/fa2fa899f0afb05d6837885523503a2d4df434f9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$E$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> is on <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/7/e/57ee5125358c0606c9b588580ddfa66f83e607b7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AB$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"14\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/d/1/5d1e4485dc90c450e8c76826516c1b2ccb8fce16.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$M$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"21\" height=\"14\" /> is on <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/b/4bbe91133fdaa92f3e58b137fdb4db178296da61.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$EB$\" width=\"28\" height=\"12\" />). If the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Area\" title=\"Area\">area</a> of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c3a2d2224f7d163b46d702132425d47828bf538.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle ABC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"61\" height=\"18\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/9/e290f2cba0ba0e11c0b91630da15a408da2fcf1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$24$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />, then the area of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/0/0/f007680c47a068a3aef3f4c57e9484da78281a63.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle BED$\" width=\"60\" height=\"13\" /> is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/7/0/970b7da9fb307f60191716f995d1ab282670d040.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(A) \\ }9 \\qquad \\mathrm{(B) \\ }12 \\qquad \\mathrm{(C) \\ } 15 \\qquad \\mathrm{(D) \\ }18 \\qquad \\mathrm{(E) \\ } \\text{Not uniquely determined}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"542\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_26&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:1984AHSME26.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/c/c3/1984AHSME26.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"470\" height=\"203\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p><p>We let side <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/5/6c52a41dcbd739f1d026c5d4f181438b75b76976.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"31\" height=\"14\" /> have length <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/7/e/57ee5125358c0606c9b588580ddfa66f83e607b7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AB$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"14\" /> have length <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/7/3372c1cb6d68cf97c2d231acc0b47b95a9ed04cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/3/a/a3ad57710b6810476e6017ea2c2cc6d41219c218.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle ABC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"57\" height=\"14\" /> have angle measure <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/d/b/fdb63b9e51abe6bbb16acfb5d7b773ddbb5bf4a8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\beta$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"10\" height=\"16\" />. We then have that\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/5/3659f3e47478054015f7ce0e256adf3bcdcd52fb.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[[ABC]=24=\\frac{AB\\cdot BC\\sin{\\angle ABC}}{2}=\\frac{ac\\sin{\\beta}}{2}\\]\" width=\"359\" height=\"37\" />\n</p><p>Now I shall find the lengths of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/9/f/89fff82bb65d0215e49c8c91cb7c553da52205e2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"32\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/3/c/13c970cbf5e2e7029089517d5e8efbb8cade6d8a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$CE$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"31\" height=\"14\" /> in terms of the defined variables. Note that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/d/1/5d1e4485dc90c450e8c76826516c1b2ccb8fce16.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$M$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"21\" height=\"14\" /> is defined to be the midpoint of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/7/e/57ee5125358c0606c9b588580ddfa66f83e607b7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AB$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"14\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/8/a/28a61551c7ad424e73644af761edaaab1aeebd7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BM=\\frac{c}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"70\" height=\"33\" />. We can then use trigonometric manipulation on triangle <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/8/0/e8037ca520b86df837e67e5c3bec56ee599d3b2f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BDM$\" width=\"49\" height=\"12\" /> to get that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/4/e24beab425af8235b45279e5af3d2562943853a9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BD=\\frac{c\\cos{\\beta}}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"106\" height=\"38\" />. We can also use trig manipulation on <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/1/2/91275aa1f85be8f39ea3ae3cef68f10100fc664b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BCE$\" width=\"43\" height=\"12\" /> to get that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/0/c/10c1c20611ce0c56b964e68ccb16ddcd3d6bfc4d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$CE=a\\tan{\\beta}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"108\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p><p>Now note that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/3/c/13c970cbf5e2e7029089517d5e8efbb8cade6d8a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$CE$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"31\" height=\"14\" /> is the height of triangle <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/e/96e81e1599a08776bb0799f73128f99332c1d78f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BDE$\" width=\"44\" height=\"12\" /> originating from vertex <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/a/2/fa2fa899f0afb05d6837885523503a2d4df434f9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$E$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" />, so we have that\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/0/1/a018f442c34cd505453691b07c39ed7dbfdd1927.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$[BED]=\\frac{BD\\cdot CE}{2}=\\frac{ac\\cos{\\beta}\\tan{\\beta}}{4}=\\frac{ac\\sin{\\beta}}{4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"373\" height=\"39\" />\n</p><p>However, this is simply half the area of triangle <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/a/e2a559986ed5a0ffc5654bd367c29dfc92913c36.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"44\" height=\"14\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/d/efd0a21e5df81526e82a873f9d6da6cc68b79695.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$[BED]=12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"96\" height=\"18\" />, which makes <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/2/7/c27f60ab9118fe60e2d0a4614c01f1e9824c2c5b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{B}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"25\" height=\"23\" /> the correct answer.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_26&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/a/bcaf8e9153da174f4e32395bf4a18ead4b2ea13a.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy]  unitsize(1cm);   pair B = (0,0); pair C = (6,0); pair A = (8,6);  pair D = (4, 0);   pair E = (6, 4.5);    pair M = (4, 3);   draw(B--A--C--cycle, linewidth(1pt));  draw(M--D, linewidth(0.8pt));          draw(D--E, linewidth(0.8pt));          draw(E--C, linewidth(0.8pt));          draw(M--C, linewidth(0.8pt));  void drawRightAngle(pair a, pair b, pair c, real size=0.3) {     path r = (b + size*unit(a-b)) -- (b + size*unit(a-b) + size*unit(c-b)) -- (b + size*unit(c-b));     draw(r); }  drawRightAngle(M, D, B);  drawRightAngle(E, C, B);  label(&quot;$A$&quot;, A, NE); label(&quot;$B$&quot;, B, SW); label(&quot;$C$&quot;, C, SE); label(&quot;$D$&quot;, D, S); label(&quot;$E$&quot;, E, NW); label(&quot;$M$&quot;, M, NW);  [/asy]\" width=\"425\" height=\"328\" />\n</p><p>Connect points <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/d/1/5d1e4485dc90c450e8c76826516c1b2ccb8fce16.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$M$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"21\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/3/c3355896da590fc491a10150a50416687626d7cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> to make <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/6/a/e6a5dab0650ea78f80ca12d62afe83905de42ceb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\overline{MC}$\" width=\"34\" height=\"15\" />. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/a/1/1a124e1a051e49614c1ac67f9a5be16ed24b9ac5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$[BED]$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"57\" height=\"20\" /> can be expressed as the sum of two smaller triangles:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/a/1/ea1ff70ca3839c1cb020dea8ecf132a20fc67ff9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$[BED] = [MDB]+[EMD]$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"223\" height=\"20\" />. Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/0/a/80ac4a7910e8eafc28e102b9797fd7cd045a8546.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle EMD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"68\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/b/d/fbd49866ccbb94527a18244f3afa85fdcbe87eaf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle MDC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"67\" height=\"18\" /> share the same base <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/2/f/f2f00f55b6b1cf59b8a3b3687a2b9aed8b37578c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$MD$\" width=\"34\" height=\"12\" /> and height along the same line, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/a/3/ca374bd4fb4c255f1427e55e2fdfac06f5e62e9b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$[EMD] = [MDC]$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"145\" height=\"20\" />.\nTherefore,<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/2/1/d21ebaa9ea75f872ecbd7a914b2b334d30b88c35.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$[BED] = [MDB] + [MDC] = [MBC] = \\frac{1}{2}*[ABC] = \\frac{1}{2}*24 = 12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"528\" height=\"38\" />. The answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/f/5/3f58d2efaaa17d28cec9dd927d78708a63b43e24.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{C}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"26\" height=\"24\" />.\n</p><p>-BiegeTomcat72\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_26&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME\" title=\"1984 AHSME\">1984 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1984 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1984 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1984\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_25\" title=\"1984 AHSME Problems/Problem 25\">Problem 25</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_27\" title=\"1984 AHSME Problems/Problem 27\">Problem 27</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1984 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1984 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1984 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1984 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1984 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1984 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\